	"html": "<main><div role=\"main\" class=\"container main-container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"it-content__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-content\" class=\"region content\"><div id=\"it-block-italiagov-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\"><div class=\"blocco-societa-trasparente\"><div class=\"title-wrapper\"><a href=\"/en/transparent-company\" class=\"back-societa-trasparente\">BACK</a><h2>Document for year: 2022</h2></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Controls and reliefs on the administration</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#independent-assessment-bodies-assessment-teams-or-other-bodies-with-similar-functions\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Independent assessment bodies, assessment teams or other bodies with similar functions</div></a></h3><div id=\"independent-assessment-bodies-assessment-teams-or-other-bodies-with-similar-functions\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>In data 16.06.2022 il Presidente del CDA ha conferito incarico inerente l’attività di attestazione degli obblighi di pubblicazione all’Organismo di Vigilanza in composizione collegiale</p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#attestation-by-the-oiv-or-other-similar-structure-in-the-fulfilment-of-publication-obligations\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Attestation by the OIV or other similar structure in the fulfilment of publication obligations</div></a></h3><div id=\"attestation-by-the-oiv-or-other-similar-structure-in-the-fulfilment-of-publication-obligations\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file