"application/pdf\">C.V.BAGGIANI -22.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-06/CV%20BROGI%20-22.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">CV BROGI -22.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><div class=\"no-genitore\">Activities and procedures</div></h3><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>The Company has no activities or procedures provided art. 35 co.1 of Legislative Decree 33/2013.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Information on individual procedures</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#anac-fulfilments-pdf\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>ANAC Fulfilments pdf</div></a></h3><div id=\"anac-fulfilments-pdf\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-01/2022%20Adempimenti%20L%20190.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">2022 Adempimenti L 190.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#anac-fulfilments-xml\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>ANAC Fulfilments xml</div></a></h3><div id=\"anac-fulfilments-xml\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-xml file--general\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-06/2022.xml\" type=\"application/xml\">2022.xml</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Grants, contributions, subsidies, economic benefits</div><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><strong>TUSCANY REGION</strong><br>Environment and Energy Directorate<br>Local Public Services, Energy, Air Pollution Sector<br>Managerial Decree no. 21934 of 03.11.2022<br>Subject of the deed: Partial liquidation of commitments undertaken in favour of the company GIDA Spa with DD no. 6630 of 23.11.2005</p><p><br>1.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Framework Programme Agreement for water protection and integrated management of water resources. Supplementary agreement for the protection of the water resources of the Middle Valdarno and the aquifers of Prato and Pistoia.<br>2.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Commitment Number: no. 9341/2022&nbsp;<br>3.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Settlement amount for the year 2022: 275,000.00 / Mandate no. 48448 of 18.11.22</p><p><br>4.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Urgent interventions aimed at resolving the most serious situations of water shortages for drinking water purposes and reducing polluting emissions released into water bodies – L. 36/94 - L.R.81/95<br>5.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Commitment number: no. 9340/2022<br>6.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Liquidation Amount Year 2022: 33,131.39 / Mandate no. 48447 of 18.11.22</p><p>&nbsp;</p>&nbsp;\n&nbsp;<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#criteria-and-procedures\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Criteria and procedures</div></a></h3><div id=\"criteria-and-procedures\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2022-05/MODALI~1.PDF\" type=\"application/pdf\">MODALI~1.PDF</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#deed-of-sponsorship\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Deed of Sponsorship</div></a></h3><div id=\"deed-of-sponsorship\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2022-05/Delibera%20CDA%2024%20marzo%202022%20-%20Estratto.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Delibera CDA 24 marzo 2022 - Estratto.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#list-of-sponsorships---donations\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>List of sponsorships / donations</div></a></h3><div id=\"list-of-sponsorships---donations\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2022-09/FILE%20SPONSORIZZAZIONI%202022%20rev.1.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">FILE SPONSORIZZAZIONI 2022 rev.1.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#initiatives---projects\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Initiatives - Projects</div></a></h3><div id=\"initiatives---projects\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2022-05/FORUM%20ACQUA%202022.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">FORUM ACQUA 2022.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#approved-financial-statements\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>APPROVED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div></a></h3><div id=\"approved-financial-statements\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-07/Relazione%20KPMG%20revisione%20Bilancio%202022_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Relazione KPMG revisione Bilancio 2022_0.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-07/Relazione%20del%20collegio%20sindacale%20al%20bilancio%202022.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Relazione del collegio sindacale al bilancio 2022.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-07/Bilancio%202022%20approvato%20il%2011-07-2023.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Bilancio 2022 approvato il 11-07-2023.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-07/Relazione%20sulla%20gestione%202022.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Relazione sulla gestione 2022.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>&nbsp;</p>&nbsp;\n&nbsp;<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#administrative-measures\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Administrative measures</div></a></h3><div id=\"administrative-measures\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>- The Company has not received any measures of the public&nbsp; shareholder that set specific objectives, annual and multi-year, on all operating expenses.</p><p>- The Company, also,&nbsp; has no obligation in relation to the pursuit of the specific, annual and multi-year objectives on all operating expenses set by Public Administration.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Services provided</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#costs-accounted\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>costs accounted</div></a></h3><div id=\"costs-accounted\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-12/Costi%20Contabilizzati%20art.32%20co.2%20D.lgs_.%2033-2013%20smi_1.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Costi Contabilizzati art.32 co.2 D.lgs_. 33-2013 smi_1.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#waiting-lists\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Waiting lists</div></a></h3><div id=\"waiting-lists\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>It applies exclusively to institutions, companies and private structures that provide services on behalf of the NHS.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#network-services\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Network Services</div></a></h3><div id=\"network-services\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>It does not apply because G.I.D.A is not a company, wholly owned by public bodies or with prevalent public capital included in the consolidated income statement of the public administration as identified by ISTAT.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Other contents</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#mog-231-01\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>MOG 231-01</div></a></h3><div id=\"mog-231-01\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><a href=\"/mog-231-01\">Mog 231 01</a></p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#civic-access\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Civic Access</div></a></h3><div id=\"civic-access\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Applications may be lodged to : Chairman of the Board of Directors <a href=\"mailto:gida@pec.uipservizi.it\" class=\"\">gida@pec.uipservizi.it</a> phone: +39 -0574-646511</p><p>In case of delay or failure to reply: Administration, Finance and Control Coordinator <a href=\"mailto:gida@pec.uipservizi.it\" class=\"\">gida@pec.uipservizi.it</a>&nbsp; phone:+39 -0574-646511</p>&nbsp;\n&nbsp;<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2022-05/REGISTRO%20ACCESSI%20I%5E%20SEMESTRE.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">REGISTRO ACCESSI I^ SEMESTRE.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2022-05/MODALITA%27%20OPERATIVE.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">MODALITA' OPERATIVE.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2023-02/REGISTRO%20ACCESSI%20II%5E%20SEMESTRE.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">REGISTRO ACCESSI II^ SEMESTRE.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </main>"
